      "statusChangeNewStatus": "available in future release",
      "value": "There are two parts to this:\n\n1. We will introduce a new version of VRCRaycast that provides an option for whether or not the ray can hit trigger colliders. This is necessary because colliders on other players are triggers. The original version is still selectable as a drop down in the SDK, and existing avatars using this component already will continue using the old version until they are updated and reuploaded by their creators.\n\n2. We will change the collision shape on other players from a sphere positioned around their feet to a capsule that matches the shape used by the local player.\n\nWe are planning to describe these changes in more detail in our next developer update.",
